Warszawa, Biblioteka Uniwersytecka
PL-Wu ms. RM 4138 (olim Ms. Mf. 2005)
Folios 121 à 123</track-text>
                <track-text descriptor="document-transcriber" x="84" y="1025" alignment="0" visibility="1" dx="2593" dy="27146" cx="0" cy="0" screen-dx="0" screen-dy="0">Jean-Daniel Forget [PLWu2005_44]
